### =====================================================================
### DRMAYDAY BACKEND - HTTP REQUEST TEST SUITE (profile and admin user endpoints)
### Use with IntelliJ IDEA or VS Code (REST Client extension)
### =====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### AUTH_LOGIN: Log in with a phone number and password
### The sample admin account is created by DatabaseSeeder
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### Successful login (200 OK)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "0900000001",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Successful logout (200 OK; the token is revoked)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Request a password reset code (SMS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "0912345678"
}

### Change password (the current token will be revoked)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_password": "Admin@123",
  "new_password": "Admin@456",
  "confirm_password": "Admin@456"
}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 0. SETUP: GENERATE LOCAL DEVELOPMENT TEST TOKENS
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 0.1 Generate an admin JWT
# @name getAdminToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/dev-token?userId=1&phone=0900000001&role=admin

### Store the adminToken from the response in a variable
@adminToken = {{getAdminToken.response.body.data.token}}


### 0.2 Generate a patient JWT
# @name getPatientToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/dev-token?userId=2&phone=0912345678&role=patient

### Store the patientToken from the response in a variable
@patientToken = {{getPatientToken.response.body.data.token}}


### =====================================================================
### PART 1: AUTHENTICATION AND PATIENT PROFILES (PROFILE_GET and PROFILE_PUT)
### =====================================================================

### PROFILE_GET - Get the authenticated patient's profile (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### PROFILE_GET - Unauthenticated request (401 Unauthorized - Code 3003)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile

### PROFILE_PUT - Patient updates their profile (200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "full_name": "Nguyễn Văn Bệnh Nhân Cập Nhật",
  "gender": "Nam",
  "year_of_birth": 1996,
  "address": "Số 1 Đại Cồ Việt, Hai Bà Trưng, Hà Nội",
  "ethnic": "Kinh",
  "occupation": "Hoc sinh - Sinh vien",
  "bhyt_code": "GD4010123456789"
}

### PROFILE_PUT - Invalid birth year (400 Bad Request - Code 2003)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year_of_birth": 1850
}


### =====================================================================
### PART 2: ADMIN USER MANAGEMENT (admin user endpoints)
### =====================================================================

### ADMIN_GET_LIST_USERS - Admin retrieves the paginated user list (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ADMIN_GET_LIST_USERS - Non-admin user is denied (403 Forbidden - Code 3102)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### ADMIN_GET_USER_DETAILS - Get user details by ID (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ADMIN_GET_USER_DETAILS - ID does not exist (404 Not Found - Code 3007)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ADMIN_CREATE_USER - Admin creates a user (201 Created - Code 1001)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Bác sĩ Nguyễn Văn C",
  "phone": "0988776656",
  "password": "Password123@",
  "role_id": "2",
  "is_active": "1"
}

### ADMIN_CREATE_USER - Phone number already exists (409 Conflict - Code 3006)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Người Trùng Số",
  "phone": "0988776656",
  "password": "Password123@",
  "role_id": "2",
  "is_active": "1"
}

### ADMIN_CREATE_USER - Required field is missing (400 Bad Request - Code 2001)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "",
  "phone": "",
  "password": "",
  "role_id": ""
}

### ADMIN_CREATE_USER - Invalid phone number format (400 Bad Request - Code 2004)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Người Sai Phone",
  "phone": "0123",
  "password": "Password123@",
  "role_id": "2"
}

### ADMIN_EDIT_USER - Update user information (200 OK - Code 1000)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Quản Trị Viên Hệ Thống Mới",
  "is_active": "1"
}

### ADMIN_EDIT_USER - Update a nonexistent user (404 Not Found - Code 3007)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Không Tồn Tại"
}


### =====================================================================
### PHẦN 3: QUẢN TRỊ QUYỀN HẠN & VAI TRÒ (APIs 19 - 23)
### =====================================================================

### API 19: perm03 / edit_permission - Chỉnh sửa thông tin quyền hạn (200 OK - Mã 1000)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/permissions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "permission_name": "manage_users_v2",
  "description": "Quản lý người dùng phiên bản 2",
  "group_name": "USER_MANAGEMENT"
}

### API 19: perm03 / edit_permission - Quyền hạn không tồn tại (404 Not Found - Mã 2006)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/permissions/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "permission_name": "unknown_permission"
}

### API 20: perm04 / delete_permission - Xóa quyền hạn khỏi hệ thống (200 OK - Mã 1000)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/permissions/99
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### API 20: perm04 / delete_permission - Quyền hạn không tồn tại (404 Not Found - Mã 2006)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/permissions/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### API 21: roleperm01 / set_role_permissions - Gán danh sách quyền hạn cho vai trò (200 OK - Mã 1000)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/roles/1/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "permission_ids": ["1", "2"]
}

### API 22: roleperm02 / get_role_permissions - Lấy danh sách quyền hạn của vai trò (200 OK - Mã 1000)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/roles/1/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### API 23: roleperm03 / delete_role_permissions - Thu hồi một quyền hạn khỏi vai trò (200 OK - Mã 1000)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/roles/1/permissions/2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### =====================================================================
### PART 5: ADMIN USER, ROLE AND PERMISSION MANAGEMENT (APIs 13 - 18)
### =====================================================================

### API 13: ADMIN_DELETE_USER - Delete an existing user (200 OK)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/9
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### API 13: ADMIN_DELETE_USER - User does not exist (404 Not Found)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### API 14: ADMIN_ASSIGN_USER - Assign staff to branch, department and room (200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "1",
  "branch_id": "1",
  "department_id": "1",
  "room_id": "1"
}

### API 14: ADMIN_ASSIGN_USER - Required field is missing (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "1",
  "branch_id": "1",
  "department_id": "1"
}

### API 15: RBAC_SET_ROLE - Create a role (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role_name": "branch_manager",
  "description": "Branch manager",
  "parent_role_id": null
}

### API 15: RBAC_SET_ROLE - Role name is required (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Missing role name"
}

### API 16: RBAC_GET_ROLE - Get roles (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### API 17: RBAC_SET_PERMISSION - Create a permission (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "permission_name": "USER_VIEW",
  "description": "View users",
  "group_name": "USER_MANAGEMENT"
}

### API 17: RBAC_SET_PERMISSION - Permission name is required (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Missing permission name"
}

### API 18: RBAC_GET_LIST_PERMISSION - Get permissions (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
